        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion K-38-F2, Keyed Entry Traditional Cambridge Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classically styled knob is made out of solid brass. Available in brushed nickel ,oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes, it will look great in both traditional and modern style homes. An ANSI grade 1 lock, it will fit doors from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches; and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion K-38-F2 Grade 1 Cambridge Knob and Traditional Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Levers are field reversible</li>\r\n<li>Bump and pick resistant lock cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Certified ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway & pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Keyed Door Knob Fusion 38  F2:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>Includes 2 homeowner keys.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <B>Single Cylinder</b> Keyed Entry Knob is operated by a key on the outside and a push-button on the inside.\r\n</p>",
